      "id": "q_5_remedy",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "A common possible slip here is to use the right rule on the wrong structure.\n\nFor this question:\n\nWhat is 256^0.25?\n\nStart from this clue:\n0.25 = 1/4.\n\nThen follow the second clue and solve only after the expression is rewritten correctly.",
